gNA6-PKUkC_childItem_6","label":"ggNA6-PKUkC_childItem_6","default":"<p>Does it work on small breeds too?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNA6-PKUkC_childItem_7","label":"ggNA6-PKUkC_childItem_7","default":"<p>Do the wipes really fit on your finger?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggj7l5Lkt6H_text","label":"ggj7l5Lkt6H_text","default":"<p>Yes! Older dogs often have an even greater need for gentle cleaning.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggu3VyYyQKN_text","label":"ggu3VyYyQKN_text","default":"<p>Daily use gives the best results – but even 3–4 times per week makes a big difference.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7iNLny3s8_text","label":"gg7iNLny3s8_text","default":"<p><strong>Yes.</strong> FreshWipes are pH-balanced, fragrance-free, and developed with a strong focus on safety and gentleness for your dog’s mouth..<br>They contain natural ingredients that are kind to both teeth and gums.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmHwL3OomU_text","label":"ggmHwL3OomU_text","default":"<p><strong>Yes!</strong> From 8 weeks and up – perfect for introducing oral care early on.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7_D8PixTc_text","label":"gg7_D8PixTc_text","default":"<p><strong>No.</strong> FreshWipes are pre-moistened with a natural solution that both cleans and freshens.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggF5YOVOzu4_text","label":"ggF5YOVOzu4_text","default":"<p>One jar contains <strong>50 wipes</strong> – enough for about <strong>1–2 months of use</strong>, depending on how often you clean.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggH-JYSzt6R_text","label":"ggH-JYSzt6R_text","default":"<p>Ja. De är 3,9 cm breda och flexibla i materialet, så de passar både smala och bredare fingrar. Du trär dem enkelt på fingertoppen och sveper – inget kladd, inget krångel.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiHaPp4ksJ_label","label":"ggiHaPp4ksJ_label","default":"<p>I want FreshWipes</p>"}],
